{
    "title": "MAJORITY: Mobile banking",
    "description": "Open an account and get a free Visa\u00ae debit card, even if you don\u2019t have an SSN. Plus, it\u2019s easier and more affordable to connect home with our competitive exchange rates on money transfers, fee-free mobile top-ups, and free international calling to 20+ countries.\r\n\r\nALL-IN-ONE MEMBERSHIP INCLUDES:\r\n\r\n\u2013FDIC-insured account, no minimum deposit\r\n\u2013Free Visa debit card with cashback\r\n\u2013MAJORITY Pay: Instantly pay members\r\n\u2013International money transfers\r\n\u2013No-fee mobile top-ups and data bundles\r\n\u2013Free international calling to select countries\r\n\u2013Dedicated customer support, also in Spanish\r\n\u2013Anti-fraud protection\r\n\u2013No hidden fees\r\n\r\nAll these benefits in one convenient app\u2013only $5.99/month.\r\n\r\nTry it for free with a 30-day free trial and discover all the benefits of MAJORITY for yourself.\r\n\r\nNo Social Security number? No problem! We accept most international government-issued photo IDs, such as a passport.\r\n\r\nMAJORITY ACCOUNT AND VISA DEBIT CARD\r\n\r\nOpen an FDIC-insured account even without SSN and earn cashback at popular merchants with your free Visa debit card. No overdraft or foreign transaction fees.\r\n\r\nPlus:\r\n\u2013Pay other members instantly with MAJORITY Pay\r\n\u2013Link your account to Zelle\u00ae, Venmo, and Cash App\r\n\u2013Get paid 2 days early with direct deposit\r\n\u2013No minimum deposit or balance\r\n\u2013Access to 55,000+ fee-free ATMs\r\n\r\nINTERNATIONAL MONEY TRANSFERS\r\n\r\nTransfer money fast at competitive exchange rates with no hidden fees and secure delivery. Send bank transfers, cash pickups, or mobile wallet transfers.\r\n\r\nSend money to Mexico, Colombia, Venezuela, Nicaragua, Honduras, Ecuador, Dominican Republic, Nigeria, Ghana, and many more.\r\n\r\nNO-FEE MOBILE TOP-UPS\r\n\r\nTop up mobile phones around the world, including Cuba, Venezuela, Mexico, and more. Get special promotional offers and send top-ups fee-free with instant, secure delivery.\r\n\r\nPlus, send data bundles with data, mobile minutes, and texts so you can always stay connected to family back home.\r\n\r\nFREE AND LOW-COST INTERNATIONAL CALLING\r\n\r\nSave on all your international calls! Free calling to Mexico, Colombia, Spain, Canada, and 20+ countries, plus the best calling rates to Cuba, Venezuela, and many more. Call any phone including landlines. No internet required.\r\n\r\nSIGN UP TODAY!\r\n\r\nBecome a MAJORITY member today! Download the app and start your 30-day free trial.\r\n\r\nNeed assistance with MAJORITY? Our dedicated customer service team is here to help in your language.\r\n\r\nFor more information, including our Privacy Policy which will tell you how we collect, use, and protect your data, visit www.MAJORITY.com!\r\n\r\nThe MAJORITY app facilitates banking services through, and the MAJORITY Visa\u00ae debit card is issued by, Axiom Bank, N.A., Members FDIC, pursuant to a license from Visa U.S.A. Inc.\r\n\r\nEarly access to direct deposit funds depends on the timing of the submission of the payment file from the payer. We generally make these funds available on the day the payment file is received, which may be up to 2 days earlier than the scheduled payment date.\r\n\r\n\u00a9 2019\u20132024 MAJORITY USA, LLC. All rights reserved.\r\nMAJORITY, 2509 N. Miami Avenue #101, Miami, Florida 33127",
